close_reason: "Merged in #137 (2cdffd9). Budgets now apply to the chosen rendered format (json/markdown/prompt/slack), compacting progressively with omission counts and retrieval hints, or failing with an explicit cannot-fit (minimum budget + recovery command, exit 2). Orchestrator verified with an independent 240-case sweep across all formats: 151 fit, 89 explicit cannot-fit whose stated minimum fits in every case, 0 violations. npm+Bun release:check passed (367 tests). CodeRabbit full review of all 9 files: no findings."
